  $txt$A modern chypre without the oakmoss weight. Iris root gives the grey, ambrette gives the skin, and a saline accord keeps the whole thing moving like wind off water.

Bright at a distance, quietly bitter up close.$txt$, 'Naomi Feldt', 2020, '#8fa39b', false, 'available', 4, true
